{"task_id": "LABOR_010", "task_type": "direct_retrieval", "difficulty": "easy", "jurisdiction": "CN", "applicable_date": "2024-06-01", "prompt": "经济补偿的工作年限如何折算？不足六个月怎么算？ 请基于2024年6月1日适用的法律，先检索法规，再给出简洁的结论、必要条件和条文ID；如信息不足，请指出缺失事实，不得编造。", "gold_article_ids": ["labor_contract_law:47"], "gold_issues": ["经济补偿年限"], "expected_answer_points": ["每满一年一个月工资；六个月以上不满一年按一年；不足六个月按半个月。具体工资基数另须依法确定。"], "missing_facts": [], "qualification": "", "source_evidence": [{"article_id": "labor_contract_law:47", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动合同法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3@cc22abe848675f05", "effective_from": "2013-07-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3", "text_sha256": "3dd81a8ba27f4c155a1e926474e216862829f813e9f97b40acc9ddd11eb8536d", "supporting_quote": "不满六个月的，向劳动者支付半个月工资的经济补偿"}], "review": {"source_anchor_verified": true, "review_method": "assistant_manual_substantive_review_plus_programmatic_exact_quote_matching", "independent_human_legal_expert_review": "pending", "intended_use": "RL pilot; not legal advice"}, "split": "test"}
{"task_id": "LABOR_027", "task_type": "fact_application", "difficulty": "medium", "jurisdiction": "CN", "applicable_date": "2024-06-01", "prompt": "公司以“员工不胜任”为由当日解除，但从未培训或调整岗位。只据第四十条第二项，解除条件是否已经齐备？ 请基于2024年6月1日适用的法律，先检索法规，再给出简洁的结论、必要条件和条文ID；如信息不足，请指出缺失事实，不得编造。", "gold_article_ids": ["labor_contract_law:40"], "gold_issues": ["不胜任解除要件"], "expected_answer_points": ["尚未满足该项所要求的培训或调岗后仍不能胜任的条件，不能仅凭一次不胜任即当然适用该项解除。"], "missing_facts": [], "qualification": "", "source_evidence": [{"article_id": "labor_contract_law:40", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动合同法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3@cc22abe848675f05", "effective_from": "2013-07-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3", "text_sha256": "c3de0fde2f9bafff4cc8a65e2b68af38580403ec8a65a92ee04cb381e801751e", "supporting_quote": "经过培训或者调整工作岗位，仍不能胜任工作的"}], "review": {"source_anchor_verified": true, "review_method": "assistant_manual_substantive_review_plus_programmatic_exact_quote_matching", "independent_human_legal_expert_review": "pending", "intended_use": "RL pilot; not legal advice"}, "split": "test"}
{"task_id": "LABOR_020", "task_type": "fact_application", "difficulty": "medium", "jurisdiction": "CN", "applicable_date": "2024-06-01", "prompt": "公司招聘新员工时要求交纳2000元“上岗保证金”，离职才退。该做法有何合规问题？ 请基于2024年6月1日适用的法律，先检索法规，再给出简洁的结论、必要条件和条文ID；如信息不足，请指出缺失事实，不得编造。", "gold_article_ids": ["labor_contract_law:9", "labor_contract_law:84"], "gold_issues": ["招聘保证金", "禁止收取财物"], "expected_answer_points": ["不得要求劳动者担保或收取财物；涉嫌违法收取保证金，存在责令退还及法定处罚风险。"], "missing_facts": [], "qualification": "", "source_evidence": [{"article_id": "labor_contract_law:9", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动合同法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3@cc22abe848675f05", "effective_from": "2013-07-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3", "text_sha256": "2d4b0a7c85cd9743103ec14d993850450c3bdbb1bac035071a3c1b02c851e4a9", "supporting_quote": "不得要求劳动者提供担保"}, {"article_id": "labor_contract_law:84", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动合同法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3@cc22abe848675f05", "effective_from": "2013-07-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3", "text_sha256": "e0b9eb775ef7b2718835da47cc53b0c3404becfa043200bae3aecce7968e4c3b", "supporting_quote": "以担保或者其他名义向劳动者收取财物的"}], "review": {"source_anchor_verified": true, "review_method": "assistant_manual_substantive_review_plus_programmatic_exact_quote_matching", "independent_human_legal_expert_review": "pending", "intended_use": "RL pilot; not legal advice"}, "split": "test"}
